    rdfs:label "As defined by GLUE theory37, the manifold capacity α is: α = ( 1 P ∫DT minV∈A..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "As defined by GLUE theory37, the manifold capacity α is: α = ( 1 P ∫DT minV∈Ay||V −T|| 2 2) −1 , (1) where DT is the zero-mean Gaussian measure and T is a random vector with dimension N." .

kb:74c5eefd-94f0-5d79-b224-88a98335ab6e a ner:Sentence ;
