    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "The appetitive behavior score ζ for each odor was computed as described based on quantitative analyses of swimming speed, the z-position in the water column, the presence in the reward zone, water surface sampling, the distance to odor inflow tube and rhythmic circular swimming during the 30 s between odor onset and reward delivery57." .

