kb:4a551aa7-b02e-5bd6-97ae-e330d65ab029 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Previous studies showed that odor-evoked activity in pDp is distributed, vari..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Previous studies showed that odor-evoked activity in pDp is distributed, variable, modified by experience, and under strong inhibitory control39–44, consistent with observations in piriform cortex19–21,23–25,29–31,45,46." .

