kb:57bba02b-5a15-53fd-8d26-d9e5e54327dc a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "While our results do not exclude the possibility that subsets of neurons in p..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "While our results do not exclude the possibility that subsets of neurons in pDp are influenced by attractor dynamics, which may be governed by networks in other brain areas, population activity in pDp did not exhibit obvious signs of classical or chaotic global attractor states." .

