kb:5859f474-caf7-54a3-b211-a88caef61f84 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Geometrical features of neural manifolds relevant for pattern classification ..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Geometrical features of neural manifolds relevant for pattern classification can be further analyzed using ‘Geometry Linked to Untangling Efficiency’ (GLUE) theory37, a mathematical framework that extends previous analytical approaches2,15,38." .

