kb:977929f6-8fcd-50d2-be68-3e33ee093329 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "h, Simplified illustration of learning-related changes in manifold geometry: ..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "h, Simplified illustration of learning-related changes in manifold geometry: E/I-assemblies for learned odors (A1 and A2) result in a directional displacement and extension of the corresponding manifolds that can be attributed, at least in part, to a modest amplification of activity within the assembly." .

