kb:ac8aa075-ae6f-57f5-989b-c404a8edc064 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Neurons with elevated firing rates that outlasted stimulus presentation were ..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Neurons with elevated firing rates that outlasted stimulus presentation were consistently enriched in cluster 2 while clusters 1 and 3 represented neurons whose activity decreased or increased, respectively, after stimulus onset (c-e)." .

