    ner:sentenceText "Optogenetic stimulation of the olfactory bulb Blue light was targeted to the ipsilateral olfactory bulb through an optical fiber (200 μm diameter, Thorlabs) using a 457 nm laser (500 mW before attenuation) as described49." .

