kb:30c12626-e6c7-5d84-b3d9-bb33456bdbd5 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Spiking network model of pDp The spiking network model of pDp was the same as..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Spiking network model of pDp The spiking network model of pDp was the same as in a previous study32 except for the number of neurons and synaptic weights to account for the smaller size of the juvenile zebrafish brain." .

kb:3416dd3c-7cf6-5257-8b6c-cf23ff7da0fb a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Learning was assumed to enhance connectivity between small assemblies of stro..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Learning was assumed to enhance connectivity between small assemblies of strongly activated neurons (100 excitatory and 25 inhibitory neurons), which resulted in the separation of manifolds representing learned and related odors from other manifolds." .

kb:34f94c27-3ebf-5b22-9c82-20084ef6e541 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "dM was increased predominantly in the direction from conditioned to other odo..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "dM was increased predominantly in the direction from conditioned to other odors (from an activity vector representing a conditioned odor to a distribution of activity vectors representing another conditioned or a novel odor), with the largest increases in the direction from the CS+ to non-conditioned odors (dMTrp→Ser, dMTrp→His; Extended Data Fig." .

