kb:7f75cf0e-6b16-5501-95de-96933bdf57e6 a ner:Sentence ;
    rdfs:label "Capacity was consistently higher in trained fish but statistical significance..." ;
    ner:partOfDocumentVersion kb:a6a2cf3f-c89a-56c0-88fa-031f7afd0daa ;
    ner:sentenceText "Capacity was consistently higher in trained fish but statistical significance was reached only in a few cases (Phe-Trp in Arg+/ Phe− fish; Phe-Trp and Arg-Trp in Phe+/Arg− fish; Phe-Arg in Phe+/Trp− fish), possibly because the number of datapoints for comparison of single odor pairs in individual training groups is low." .

